  "body": "Opportunities like this simply do not come along. Set on the final developable site on the seaview side of exclusive Ronaki Road, this elevated 1,416sqm landholding offers a scale, position and outlook that is exceptionally hard to find in the Eastern Bays. Spectacular harbour panoramas make this the kind of property buyers wait years for.\r\n \r\nThe premium location is second to none, with Mission Bay, Kohimarama, St Heliers and the full sweep of Eastern Bays beaches all just moments away, each popular for their cafés, restaurants, shopping and everyday amenities. A quick connection to Auckland's CBD along picturesque Tamaki Drive completes a lifestyle that is hard to match.\r\n \r\nThe existing home offers immediate holding income or comfortable liveability, but it is the future potential that will capture attention. Build, landbank, renovate or redevelop: the options are compelling, and the opportunity is finite.\r\nLand of this size, at this elevation, with this outlook and this address, is exceptionally hard to secure. In one of Auckland's most tightly held coastal locations, this is a standout chance to secure something truly special.\r\n\r\n*some images are architectural renders\r\n\r\n\r\nImportant: This property may be marketed as suitable for overseas purchasers. However, this does not constitute confirmation of eligibility, approval, or suitability for any individual buyer. All overseas purchasers remain subject to New Zealand’s overseas investment laws, including the Overseas Investment Act 2005, and may require consent from the Overseas Investment Office. You must obtain your own independent legal, financial, and technical advice and secure any necessary approvals before proceeding with a purchase.",
